alk about:<br> <ul><li>things in general</li> <li>things that happen regularly</li> <li>things that do not change</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form: subject + verb (affirmative) <br> Form: Question Word + do/does + subject + main verb  (question)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about:<br> <ul><li>something that is happening now</li> <li>something that is happening around now (today)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form : subject + to be + verb<span class=\"underline\">ing</span> (affirmative) <br> Form: Question Word + is/are + subject + main verb<span class=\"underline\">ing</span> (question)"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Present \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Many tourists go to the parade every year.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hailey is going to the parade today.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Where does the ship stop?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Where is the ship stopping today?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Do many people go to the parade?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Is anyone on board going to the parade?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Carnival "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a celebration in many countries "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I go to Brazil for Carnival every year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about Carnival."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "event"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something important that happens  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Carnival is an amazing, once-a-year event."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "costume"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "special clothes for a party or event "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They all wear beautiful costumes at Carnival."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "highlight "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the best part "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The highlight of the event is the samba parade."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lively"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "with a lot of energy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The music is lively."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "parade"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a special event when people walk or ride in the same direction"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are thousands of people in the Carnival parade."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "samba"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a dance from Brazil"